[0m
[32m| **Stage** | Seed‑stage (prototype) – typical checks $250 k–$3 M |
[0m
[32m| **Sector** | AI‑enabled health‑tech, data‑harmonization, drug‑discovery, or Alzheimer’s‑focused therapeutics |
[0m
[32m| **Geography** | Must accept U.S. (Delaware) companies and be active in 2025‑2026 |

[0m
